# Claude Code
CLAUDE.md
*_CN.md

# Claude Code per-user local overrides
.claude/settings.local.json

# Handoff artifacts — bulky screenshot uploads from user prototype iteration sessions
# (the prototype HTML itself IS committed; only the source screenshots are excluded)
.planning/handoff/*/mneme/project/uploads/

# Dev feedback loop (Phase 01.1) — ephemeral signals, never committed.
# Tracked exemptions: .gitkeep + README.md.
# NOTE: pattern is `.dev-logs/*` (contents), not `.dev-logs/` (the directory
# itself). git docs: "It is not possible to re-include a file if a parent
# directory of that file is excluded." Using the contents-glob lets the `!`
# negations actually surface .gitkeep + README.md as tracked.
.dev-logs/*
!.dev-logs/.gitkeep
!.dev-logs/README.md
